        "a face's RAGGEDNESS is the spread of its own crossover levels, in base pairs, exactly as C-0140 emits it",
        "every length is reported in RISES as well as nm, because a margin below one rise cannot be corrected, only removed",
        "the ripple transfer function is written for a SINUSOID, so the rim's square-wave modulation enters through its fundamental, 2/pi of the peak-to-peak"
